      "created_at": "2012-12-31T00:41:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>They were just letters in playtesting. That said, you could call them \"The Sun\", \"The Hand\", and \"The Ankh\" if you wanted, as those are all accurate. The Sun icon represents the sun (obviously), but also fire.<br>The Hand represents magic and the supernatural.<br>The Ankh represents life and death.</p><p>Hope this helps.</p>",
