      "raw": "<p>Ah, then I suppose it would be safe to mention my interpretation?<br /><br />The red symbols were an S, which I can only assume represents Sun (Sun&#39;s Fury, etc.)</p><p>The green symbols were an E, which I related to Element (Elemental Storm, for example)</p><p>The purple symbols were a D, which I believe is Death (Death&#39;s Grasp)</p><p>Hope this was ok to post!</p>",
